  "helpQ1": "What is Hub Market?",
  "helpA1": "Hub Market is a marketplace app: products from many local stores, in one cart with one checkout.",
  "helpQ2": "Who sells the products?",
  "helpA2": "Each product is sold by an independent store on Hub Market.",
  "helpQ4": "Can I order from several stores at once?",
  "helpA4": "Yes. Add products from any store on Hub Market to one cart and check out once.",
  "helpQ5": "How much is delivery?",
  "helpA5": "The delivery options and fees for your address are shown at checkout, before you place the order.",
  "helpQ7": "How do I track my order?",
  "helpA7": "If you're signed in, open Account › My Orders to see the status of each order. Checked out as a guest? Open Account › Track an order and enter your order number, email and last name. Orders you placed or looked up as a guest on this device also appear under Account › My Orders.",
  "helpQCancel": "Can I cancel an order?",
  "helpACancel": "While an order can still be cancelled, its page shows a Cancel order button. Once it has shipped it can't be cancelled. Don't see the button? Send us a message.",
  "helpQ8": "Can I return an item?",
  "helpA8": "Returns can't be started in the app yet. Contact us from the Help centre with your order number and we'll help.",
  "helpA8Returns": "Yes. Open Account › My returns, or the order in My Orders, and choose Return items. Pick the items and tell us why; the store that sold them replies in the return's messages. Items from different stores go in separate returns.",
  "helpQPayments": "How can I pay?",
  "helpAPayments": "At checkout you'll see every payment method available for your order, such as cash on delivery.",
  "helpQGuest": "Do I need an account to order?",
  "helpAGuest": "No, you can check out as a guest. An account keeps your addresses, wishlist and orders in one place.",
  "helpQLanguage": "How do I change the language?",
  "helpALanguage": "Use the EN / العربية toggle in the menu or in Settings.",
  "helpQDeleteAccount": "How do I delete my account?",
